  'insurance-claims-file': { title: 'The Insurance Claims File: What It Contains and Your Right to See It', description: 'The claims file is the complete record of your claim — adjuster notes, reserve history, supervisor instructions, internal communications, and expert reports. Learn what is in it, how to request it, and what it reveals.' },
