  'late-notice-coverage-defense': { title: 'Late Notice: When Your Insurer Tries to Deny Your Claim for Delayed Reporting', description: "How insurers use late notice defenses to deny claims, California's notice-prejudice rule requiring the insurer to prove actual harm from the delay, and how policyholders can counter late notice denials." },
