  'policy-rescission': { title: 'Policy Rescission: When Your Insurer Voids Your Policy as If It Never Existed', description: 'What policy rescission means, how it differs from denial or cancellation, California legal standards under Insurance Code 331 and 359, fire policy protections under IC 2071, and defenses available to policyholders.' },
