  'rate-increase-after-claim': { title: 'Will Your Insurance Go Up After Filing a Claim? What the Data Shows', description: 'How filing an insurance claim affects your premiums, how long surcharges last, the role of CLUE reports, California Prop 103 protections, and when it may not make sense to file.' },
